{"body":{"text":["What a session knows is in the field; memory is off, \"OpenLight had to set this boundary early\" (2/6). A session is kept whole in his words, every utterance as said, its answers by their essence, read against the transcripts by blank agents before it is trusted (11/105, 13/129). What matters in it is lifted into the elevation, below; the cycles, condensations and paths sessions kept before go with the redraw (23/110)."]},"id":"1M89JGAHQ3V7000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A question is held in the field: \"if something is a question, make it. In the substrate.\" (10/8). Until the redraw it stands as a thread; in the elevation it is a statement whose status is open. What a session did is committed before it ends, and no session starts on another's uncommitted work: \"We never want to start off a session with local changes.\" (4/2)."]},"id":"1M89JGAHQ3V7001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}